 ransform-origin: var(--origin-x) var(--origin-y)\; } Introducing a Special
  Transit Edition of the Cool Book Club Calling all transit wonks and Clipp
 er Card newbies: grab a drink and join the conversation to celebrate Trans
 it Month. Cool Books has a transit theme in September: we'll be talking th
 rough big ideas about how our streets\, roads\, and transit systems shape 
 daily life\, inspired by Confessions of a Recovering Engineer: Transportat
 ion for a Strong Town . Skimmed the book\, read the whole thing\, or are j
 ust curious? All are welcome! Want to take the next step to see how these 
 ideas show up locally in real life? Save the date for Friday\, September 4
 th at 11:00 AM for Read and Ride . We’ll ride the Route 11 bus together 
 with Petaluma Transit Division Manager\, Maria Arce\, to enjoy the view an
 d keep the conversation going. #block-yui_3_17_2_1_1784849916520_6085 { --
